    "此操作将使用匹配到的 RAW 文件替换原来的小图文件。\n\n替换前会先检查冲突，默认跳过重名目标。\n确认后原小图会移到废纸篓，不会直接永久删除。" : {
      "comment" : "The confirmation message for the \"Replace with RAW\" operation.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This operation will replace the original preview images with the matched RAW files.\n\nConflicts will be checked before replacing; duplicate targets are skipped by default.\nThe original images will be moved to Trash — they will not be permanently deleted."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "此操作将使用匹配到的 RAW 文件替换原来的小图文件。\n\n替换前会先检查冲突，默认跳过重名目标。\n确认后原小图会移到废纸篓，不会直接永久删除。\n完成后会显示本次任务摘要，便于复核成功、跳过与失败项。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This will replace original preview images with their matched RAW files.\n\nConflicts are checked before replacement; duplicate names are skipped by default.\nOriginal preview images will be moved to Trash, not permanently deleted.\nA task summary will be displayed upon completion for reviewing succeeded, skipped, and failed items."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此操作将使用匹配到的 RAW 文件替换原来的小图文件。\n\n替换前会先检查冲突，默认跳过重名目标。\n确认后原小图会移到废纸篓，不会直接永久删除。\n完成后会显示本次任务摘要，便于复核成功、跳过与失败项。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "此操作将重组待整理文件夹中的文件结构：\n\n1. 匹配的文件将被移动到与目标文件夹相同的相对路径下。\n2. 未匹配的文件将被移动到未整理子文件夹中。\n\n整理前会先预览匹配结果，执行时默认跳过冲突文件，不覆盖现有内容。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This operation will reorganize the folder structure of the source folder:\n\n1. Matched files will be moved to the same relative path as in the target folder.\n2. Unmatched files will be moved to an \"unorganized\" subfolder.\n\nA preview of match results will be shown before execution; conflicting files are skipped by default without overwriting existing content."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "此操作将重组待整理文件夹中的文件结构：\\n\\n1. 匹配的文件将被移动到与目标文件夹相同的相对路径下。\\n2. 未匹配的文件将被移动到未整理子文件夹中。\\n\\n整理前会先预览匹配结果，执行时默认跳过冲突文件，不覆盖现有内容。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This will reorganize the file structure in the source folder:\\n\\n1. Matched files will be moved to the same relative paths as in the target folder.\\n2. Unmatched files will be moved to an unsorted subfolder.\\n\\nMatch results are previewed before organizing; conflicting files are skipped by default without overwriting existing content."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此操作将重组待整理文件夹中的文件结构：\\n\\n1. 匹配的文件将被移动到与目标文件夹相同的相对路径下。\\n2. 未匹配的文件将被移动到未整理子文件夹中。\\n\\n整理前会先预览匹配结果，执行时默认跳过冲突文件，不覆盖现有内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
